---
description: Apollo Client and Zustand + MMKV conventions
globs: src/graphql/**/*.{ts,tsx},src/store/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# Apollo (`src/graphql`)

Links: `errorLink → authLink → httpLink` → `API_URL`.

- Tokens in SecureStore only — never MMKV
- On `Authentication required`, refresh via `refreshToken` mutation then retry
- Shared ops: `src/graphql/operations.ts`
- Feature-specific ops may live under `src/features/<x>/api/`

# Zustand + MMKV (`src/store`)

```ts
import { create } from "zustand";
import { persist, createJSONStorage } from "zustand/middleware";
```

- Persist non-sensitive UI prefs (e.g. last search city) to MMKV
- Auth user/session: React context + SecureStore (`src/graphql/auth.tsx`)
